{
  "_comment": "Scorecards per stage. gate: pass/fail. score: normalised 0-100 between floor and target (floor may be above target for lower-is-better). method S script, J judge (advisory until calibrated), E explorer. rubric names the judge rubric whose calibration decides whether a J metric counts. Source of every threshold: plans/phase-cd-scorecards.md.",
